cene, the second witness's later departure must still fan a\nfresh hearsay copy out, attributed to *that* witness as\n``told_by``. Locking this catches a regression where the\npropagation tag was stored on the node and the second departure\nbecame a silent no-op.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"e42dfa06ed92a8a2065e38f1f35585c2","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"4237c906ac01c1d1284192d96542288b","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"e4dede7efecd03b0c9e467f7df660cc8","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_memory_preservation"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_memory_preservation.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[],"order":1583,"categories":[]}